{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2633","id":2549045326,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz886X71hO","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2633","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2633.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2633.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2633","number":2633,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix: Populate user name from email prefix if OIDC username is invalid","user":{"login":"0xlilim","id":106388323,"node_id":"U_kgDOBldbYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106388323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xlilim","html_url":"https://github.com/0xlilim","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xlilim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xlilim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xlilim/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xlilim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xlilim/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xlilim/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xlilim/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xlilim/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xlilim/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Fixed: Populate user name from email prefix if OIDC username is invalid.**\r\n\r\nWhen a user authenticates via OIDC and the `preferred_username` claim\r\n(mapped to `claims.Username`) contains characters disallowed by\r\n`util.ValidateUsername` (e.g., CJK characters), the `User.Name` field\r\nwould remain empty. This resulted in an empty 'Name' column in the\r\n`headscale user list` output for such users.\r\n\r\nThis commit modifies the `User.FromClaim` method in\r\n`hscontrol/types/users.go` to address this issue. If `claims.Username`\r\nis empty or fails validation, the method now attempts to extract the\r\nprefix from `claims.Email` (the part before '@'). If this extracted\r\nprefix is valid according to `util.ValidateUsername`, it is used as\r\nthe `User.Name`.\r\n\r\nThis ensures that a valid username is populated when possible, even if\r\nthe OIDC `preferred_username` is not directly usable, improving the\r\nuser experience and data consistency.\r\n\r\n- [x ] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n- [ ] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [ ] added unit tests\r\n- [ ] added integration tests\r\n- [ ] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [ ] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2025-05-28T10:08:52Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T16:18:13Z","closed_at":"2025-05-28T16:18:13Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9bff3c50405b17330a4b77023def1afe4c21c5c0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url"